                "ref": "Wikipedia, Logistic function (Derivative)",
                "long": "#### Ý chính\n$\\sigma(z) = (1 + e^{-z})^{-1}$. Đạo hàm bằng quy tắc chuỗi:\n$$\\sigma'(z) = -(1 + e^{-z})^{-2} \\cdot (-e^{-z}) = \\frac{e^{-z}}{(1 + e^{-z})^2} = \\underbrace{\\frac{1}{1 + e^{-z}}}_{\\sigma(z)} \\cdot \\underbrace{\\frac{e^{-z}}{1 + e^{-z}}}_{1 - \\sigma(z)}.$$\nDạng $\\sigma(1 - \\sigma)$ rất tiện: backprop chỉ cần giá trị $\\sigma$ đã tính ở lượt xuôi.\n\n#### Từng bước: vài giá trị\n| $z$ | $\\sigma(z)$ | $\\sigma'(z) = \\sigma(1-\\sigma)$ |\n|---|---|---|\n| $0$ | $0{,}5$ | $0{,}25$ (lớn nhất) |\n| $2$ | $0{,}881$ | $0{,}105$ |\n| $5$ | $0{,}993$ | $0{,}0066$ |\n\n#### Hình minh hoạ\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 560 280\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:560px\">\n<line x1=\"48\" y1=\"233.6\" x2=\"544\" y2=\"233.6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"296.0\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"296.0\" y2=\"244\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<text x=\"48.0\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">−6</text>\n<text x=\"130.7\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">−4</text>\n<text x=\"213.3\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">−2</text>\n<text x=\"378.7\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">2</text>\n<text x=\"461.3\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">4</text>\n<text x=\"544.0\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">6</text>\n<text x=\"42\" y=\"185.8\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\">0,25</text>\n<text x=\"42\" y=\"134.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\">0,5</text>\n<text x=\"42\" y=\"30.4\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\">1</text>\n<text x=\"544\" y=\"276\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\">z</text>\n<line x1=\"48.0\" y1=\"181.8\" x2=\"544.0\" y2=\"181.8\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/>\n<polyline points=\"48.0,233.1 52.1,233.1 56.3,233.0 60.4,232.9 64.5,232.9 68.7,232.8 72.8,232.7 76.9,232.6 81.1,232.5 85.2,232.4 89.3,232.2 93.5,232.1 97.6,231.9 101.7,231.8 105.9,231.6 110.0,231.4 114.1,231.1 118.3,230.9 122.4,230.6 126.5,230.3 130.7,229.9 134.8,229.5 138.9,229.1 143.1,228.6 147.2,228.1 151.3,227.6 155.5,226.9 159.6,226.3 163.7,225.5 167.9,224.7 172.0,223.8 176.1,222.8 180.3,221.8 184.4,220.6 188.5,219.3 192.7,217.9 196.8,216.4 200.9,214.7 205.1,213.0 209.2,211.0 213.3,208.9 217.5,206.7 221.6,204.2 225.7,201.6 229.9,198.8 234.0,195.8 238.1,192.6 242.3,189.2 246.4,185.7 250.5,181.9 254.7,177.9 258.8,173.7 262.9,169.4 267.1,164.9 271.2,160.2 275.3,155.4 279.5,150.5 283.6,145.4 287.7,140.3 291.9,135.2 296.0,130.0 300.1,124.8 304.3,119.7 308.4,114.6 312.5,109.5 316.7,104.6 320.8,99.8 324.9,95.1 329.1,90.6 333.2,86.3 337.3,82.1 341.5,78.1 345.6,74.3 349.7,70.8 353.9,67.4 358.0,64.2 362.1,61.2 366.3,58.4 370.4,55.8 374.5,53.3 378.7,51.1 382.8,49.0 386.9,47.0 391.1,45.3 395.2,43.6 399.3,42.1 403.5,40.7 407.6,39.4 411.7,38.2 415.9,37.2 420.0,36.2 424.1,35.3 428.3,34.5 432.4,33.7 436.5,33.1 440.7,32.4 444.8,31.9 448.9,31.4 453.1,30.9 457.2,30.5 461.3,30.1 465.5,29.7 469.6,29.4 473.7,29.1 477.9,28.9 482.0,28.6 486.1,28.4 490.3,28.2 494.4,28.1 498.5,27.9 502.7,27.8 506.8,27.6 510.9,27.5 515.1,27.4 519.2,27.3 523.3,27.2 527.5,27.1 531.6,27.1 535.7,27.0 539.9,26.9 544.0,26.9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<polyline points=\"48.0,233.1 52.1,233.1 56.3,233.0 60.4,232.9 64.5,232.9 68.7,232.8 72.8,232.7 76.9,232.6 81.1,232.5 85.2,232.4 89.3,232.3 93.5,232.1 97.6,232.0 101.7,231.8 105.9,231.6 110.0,231.4 114.1,231.2 118.3,230.9 122.4,230.6 126.5,230.3 130.7,230.0 134.8,229.6 138.9,229.2 143.1,228.8 147.2,228.3 151.3,227.7 155.5,227.2 159.6,226.5 163.7,225.8 167.9,225.1 172.0,224.3 176.1,223.4 180.3,222.4 184.4,221.4 188.5,220.3 192.7,219.1 196.8,217.8 200.9,216.5 205.1,215.0 209.2,213.5 213.3,211.9 217.5,210.2 221.6,208.4 225.7,206.6 229.9,204.7 234.0,202.7 238.1,200.7 242.3,198.8 246.4,196.8 250.5,194.8 254.7,192.9 258.8,191.0 262.9,189.3 267.1,187.7 271.2,186.2 275.3,184.9 279.5,183.8 283.6,183.0 287.7,182.3 291.9,181.9 296.0,181.8 300.1,181.9 304.3,182.3 308.4,183.0 312.5,183.8 316.7,184.9 320.8,186.2 324.9,187.7 329.1,189.3 333.2,191.0 337.3,192.9 341.5,194.8 345.6,196.8 349.7,198.8 353.9,200.7 358.0,202.7 362.1,204.7 366.3,206.6 370.4,208.4 374.5,210.2 378.7,211.9 382.8,213.5 386.9,215.0 391.1,216.5 395.2,217.8 399.3,219.1 403.5,220.3 407.6,221.4 411.7,222.4 415.9,223.4 420.0,224.3 424.1,225.1 428.3,225.8 432.4,226.5 436.5,227.2 440.7,227.7 444.8,228.3 448.9,228.8 453.1,229.2 457.2,229.6 461.3,230.0 465.5,230.3 469.6,230.6 473.7,230.9 477.9,231.2 482.0,231.4 486.1,231.6 490.3,231.8 494.4,232.0 498.5,232.1 502.7,232.3 506.8,232.4 510.9,232.5 515.1,232.6 519.2,232.7 523.3,232.8 527.5,232.9 531.6,232.9 535.7,233.0 539.9,233.1 544.0,233.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"386.9\" y=\"63.7\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#3b82f6\">σ(z)</text>\n<text x=\"349.7\" y=\"171.5\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#10b981\">σ′(z) = σ(1−σ), đỉnh 0,25</text>\n</svg>\n\nKhi $|z|$ lớn, sigmoid **bão hoà** và $\\sigma'$ gần 0: đây là gốc của hiện tượng gradient tắt dần trong mạng sâu dùng sigmoid.\n\n#### Bẫy thường gặp\n- Nhầm với $\\tanh'(z) = 1 - \\tanh^2(z)$.\n- Quên đạo hàm hàm trong $-e^{-z}$, ra $\\frac{1}{(1+e^{-z})^2} = \\sigma^2$ (sai).\n\n```python\nimport math\ns = lambda z: 1 / (1 + math.exp(-z))\nh = 1e-6\nfor z in (0, 2, 5):\n    print(z, round((s(z + h) - s(z - h)) / (2 * h), 4), round(s(z) * (1 - s(z)), 4))\n```\n\n#### Đọc thêm\n- [Logistic function (Wikipedia)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Logistic_function)\n- [Sigmoid function (Wikipedia)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sigmoid_function)"
