                "long": "#### Ý chính\nVới loss bậc hai $L(w) = \\frac{\\lambda}{2}w^2$ (ở đây $\\lambda = 4$), mỗi bước GD nhân $w$ với cùng một hệ số $q = 1 - \\eta\\lambda$:\n- $0 < q < 1$: hội tụ đơn điệu;\n- $-1 < q < 0$: hội tụ nhưng dao động (đổi dấu);\n- $q < -1$: **phân kỳ dao động**, $|w|$ tăng theo cấp số nhân.\n\nNgưỡng ổn định: $\\eta < \\frac{2}{\\lambda} = 0{,}5$. Learning rate tối ưu cho hàm này là $\\eta = \\frac{1}{\\lambda} = 0{,}25$ (về 0 sau đúng 1 bước).\n\n#### Từng bước ($\\eta = 0{,}6$, $q = 1 - 2{,}4 = -1{,}4$)\n| $t$ | $w_t$ | $L(w_t) = 2w_t^2$ |\n|---|---|---|\n| 0 | $1$ | $2$ |\n| 1 | $-1{,}4$ | $3{,}92$ |\n| 2 | $1{,}96$ | $7{,}68$ |\n| 3 | $-2{,}744$ | $15{,}06$ |\n\n#### Hình minh hoạ\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 560 280\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:560px\">\n<line x1=\"48\" y1=\"231.3\" x2=\"544\" y2=\"231.3\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"296.0\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"296.0\" y2=\"244\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<text x=\"63.5\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">−3</text>\n<text x=\"141.0\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">−2</text>\n<text x=\"218.5\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">−1</text>\n<text x=\"373.5\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">1</text>\n<text x=\"451.0\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">2</text>\n<text x=\"528.5\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">3</text>\n<text x=\"42\" y=\"172.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\">5</text>\n<text x=\"42\" y=\"108.7\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\">10</text>\n<text x=\"42\" y=\"45.3\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\">15</text>\n<text x=\"544\" y=\"276\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\">w</text>\n<text x=\"52\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\">L(w) = 2w²</text>\n<polyline points=\"48.0,-28.1 52.1,-19.5 56.3,-11.1 60.4,-2.8 64.5,5.4 68.7,13.4 72.8,21.2 76.9,28.9 81.1,36.5 85.2,43.9 89.3,51.2 93.5,58.3 97.6,65.3 101.7,72.2 105.9,78.9 110.0,85.4 114.1,91.8 118.3,98.1 122.4,104.2 126.5,110.2 130.7,116.0 134.8,121.7 138.9,127.3 143.1,132.7 147.2,137.9 151.3,143.1 155.5,148.0 159.6,152.9 163.7,157.5 167.9,162.1 172.0,166.5 176.1,170.7 180.3,174.8 184.4,178.8 188.5,182.6 192.7,186.3 196.8,189.8 200.9,193.2 205.1,196.5 209.2,199.6 213.3,202.5 217.5,205.3 221.6,208.0 225.7,210.5 229.9,212.9 234.0,215.1 238.1,217.2 242.3,219.2 246.4,221.0 250.5,222.6 254.7,224.1 258.8,225.5 262.9,226.7 267.1,227.8 271.2,228.7 275.3,229.5 279.5,230.2 283.6,230.7 287.7,231.0 291.9,231.3 296.0,231.3 300.1,231.3 304.3,231.0 308.4,230.7 312.5,230.2 316.7,229.5 320.8,228.7 324.9,227.8 329.1,226.7 333.2,225.5 337.3,224.1 341.5,222.6 345.6,221.0 349.7,219.2 353.9,217.2 358.0,215.1 362.1,212.9 366.3,210.5 370.4,208.0 374.5,205.3 378.7,202.5 382.8,199.6 386.9,196.5 391.1,193.2 395.2,189.8 399.3,186.3 403.5,182.6 407.6,178.8 411.7,174.8 415.9,170.7 420.0,166.5 424.1,162.1 428.3,157.5 432.4,152.9 436.5,148.0 440.7,143.1 444.8,137.9 448.9,132.7 453.1,127.3 457.2,121.7 461.3,116.0 465.5,110.2 469.6,104.2 473.7,98.1 477.9,91.8 482.0,85.4 486.1,78.9 490.3,72.2 494.4,65.3 498.5,58.3 502.7,51.2 506.8,43.9 510.9,36.5 515.1,28.9 519.2,21.2 523.3,13.4 527.5,5.4 531.6,-2.8 535.7,-11.1 539.9,-19.5 544.0,-28.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<polyline points=\"373.5,206.0 187.5,181.7 447.9,134.0 83.3,40.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<circle cx=\"373.5\" cy=\"206.0\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/>\n<circle cx=\"187.5\" cy=\"181.7\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/>\n<circle cx=\"447.9\" cy=\"134.0\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/>\n<circle cx=\"83.3\" cy=\"40.6\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/>\n<text x=\"382.8\" y=\"198.4\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ef4444\">w₀</text>\n<text x=\"178.2\" y=\"174.1\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#ef4444\">w₁</text>\n<text x=\"457.2\" y=\"126.4\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ef4444\">w₂</text>\n<text x=\"74.0\" y=\"33.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#ef4444\">w₃</text>\n</svg>\n\n#### Bảng ngưỡng\n| $\\eta$ | $q = 1 - 4\\eta$ | Hành vi |\n|---|---|---|\n| $0{,}1$ | $0{,}6$ | hội tụ đơn điệu |\n| $0{,}25$ | $0$ | tới 0 sau 1 bước |\n| $0{,}4$ | $-0{,}6$ | hội tụ dao động |\n| $0{,}6$ | $-1{,}4$ | phân kỳ dao động |\n\n#### Bẫy thường gặp\n- Quên dấu âm của $q$ nên không thấy dao động.\n- Lấy $L' = 2w$ (quên hệ số 2 của $2w^2$).\n\n```python\nfor eta in (0.1, 0.25, 0.4, 0.6):\n    w = 1.0\n    for _ in range(3):\n        w -= eta * 4 * w\n    print(eta, round(w, 4))\n```\n\n#### Đọc thêm\n- [d2l.ai: Gradient Descent](https://d2l.ai/chapter_optimization/gd.html)\n- [Learning rate (Wikipedia)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Learning_rate)"
