                "ref": "OpenIntro Statistics (4th ed.), chương 2, mục 2.1 (box plots, quartiles, IQR)",
                "long": "#### Ý chính\nQuy tắc Tukey dùng tứ phân vị (bền vững với ngoại lai) thay vì trung bình và độ lệch chuẩn (bị chính ngoại lai kéo lệch). Hàng rào: $[Q_1 - 1{,}5 \\cdot IQR;\\ Q_3 + 1{,}5 \\cdot IQR]$, $IQR = Q_3 - Q_1$.\n\n#### Từng bước\n1. 12 giá trị, nửa dưới: 120, 130, 135, 140, 150, 155 nên $Q_1 = (135 + 140)/2 = 137{,}5$.\n2. Nửa trên: 160, 170, 180, 190, 260, 420 nên $Q_3 = (180 + 190)/2 = 185$.\n3. $IQR = 47{,}5$; $1{,}5 \\cdot IQR = 71{,}25$.\n4. Hàng rào: $[66{,}25;\\ 256{,}25]$. Ngoài hàng rào: **260 và 420**.\n\n```python\nimport statistics as st, numpy as np\nv = [120,130,135,140,150,155,160,170,180,190,260,420]\nq1, q3 = st.median(v[:6]), st.median(v[6:])\nprint(q1, q3, q3 + 1.5*(q3-q1))           # 137.5 185.0 256.25\nprint(np.percentile(v, [25, 75]))         # [138.75 182.5] — cách nội suy khác, vẫn ra 2 ngoại lai\n```\n\n#### Hình minh hoạ (box plot)\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 560 170\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:560px\">\n<rect x=\"85.1\" y=\"48\" width=\"69.9\" height=\"44\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" fill-opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"114.6\" y1=\"48.0\" x2=\"114.6\" y2=\"92.0\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n<line x1=\"59.4\" y1=\"70.0\" x2=\"85.1\" y2=\"70.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<line x1=\"155.0\" y1=\"70.0\" x2=\"162.4\" y2=\"70.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<line x1=\"59.4\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"59.4\" y2=\"80.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<line x1=\"162.4\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"162.4\" y2=\"80.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<line x1=\"259.8\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"259.8\" y2=\"120.0\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/>\n<text x=\"259.8\" y=\"14.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\">Q3 + 1,5·IQR = 256,25</text>\n<circle cx=\"265.3\" cy=\"70\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/>\n<circle cx=\"500.6\" cy=\"70\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/>\n<text x=\"85.1\" y=\"108.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Q1=137,5</text>\n<text x=\"155.0\" y=\"108.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Q3=185</text>\n<line x1=\"30.0\" y1=\"135.0\" x2=\"530.0\" y2=\"135.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<line x1=\"30.0\" y1=\"135.0\" x2=\"30.0\" y2=\"140.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"30.0\" y=\"154.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">100</text>\n<line x1=\"103.5\" y1=\"135.0\" x2=\"103.5\" y2=\"140.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"103.5\" y=\"154.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">150</text>\n<line x1=\"177.1\" y1=\"135.0\" x2=\"177.1\" y2=\"140.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"177.1\" y=\"154.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">200</text>\n<line x1=\"250.6\" y1=\"135.0\" x2=\"250.6\" y2=\"140.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"250.6\" y=\"154.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">250</text>\n<line x1=\"324.1\" y1=\"135.0\" x2=\"324.1\" y2=\"140.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"324.1\" y=\"154.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">300</text>\n<line x1=\"397.6\" y1=\"135.0\" x2=\"397.6\" y2=\"140.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"397.6\" y=\"154.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">350</text>\n<line x1=\"471.2\" y1=\"135.0\" x2=\"471.2\" y2=\"140.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"471.2\" y=\"154.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">400</text>\n<text x=\"500.6\" y=\"58.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\">420</text>\n<text x=\"265.3\" y=\"58.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\">260</text>\n</svg>\n\n| Quy tắc | Ngưỡng trên | Số ngoại lai |\n|---|---|---|\n| Tukey $1{,}5 \\cdot IQR$ | 256,25 | 2 |\n| \"Cực đoan\" $3 \\cdot IQR$ | 327,5 | 1 |\n| $\\bar{x} + 2s$ ($\\bar{x} \\approx 184{,}2$, $s \\approx 82{,}9$) | ≈ 350 | 1 |\n\nQuy tắc $\\bar{x} + 2s$ bị chính điểm 420 làm phình $s$ nên \"che\" điểm 260 (hiện tượng masking).\n\n#### Bẫy thường gặp\nNgoại lai theo Tukey là tín hiệu cần **điều tra** (giờ cao điểm? sự cố?), không phải tự động xoá.\n\n#### Đọc thêm\n- [Interquartile range (Wikipedia)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Interquartile_range)\n- [Box plot (Wikipedia)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Box_plot)\n"
