                "scenario": false,
                "prompt": "Đoạn code sau in ra gì?\n\n```python\ndon = pd.DataFrame({\"ma_sp\": [1, 2], \"gia\": [100, 200], \"sl\": [3, 1]})\nsp  = pd.DataFrame({\"ma_sp\": [1, 2], \"gia\": [90, 210], \"ten\": [\"Ao\", \"Mu\"]})\nr = don.merge(sp, on=\"ma_sp\")\nprint(r.columns.tolist())\n```",
