                "ref": "Anthropic, Building effective agents (2024), phần stopping conditions; OWASP LLM10:2025 Unbounded Consumption",
                "long": "#### Ý chính\n`max_steps` không nên chọn theo cảm tính mà suy ra từ ngân sách: thời gian (SLA), token hoặc tiền. Với các thao tác tuần tự, thời gian xấu nhất là tổng thời gian mọi bước cộng phần kết thúc.\n\n#### Từng bước\n1. Một bước: $t_{\\text{bước}} = 2{,}5 + 1{,}5 + 1{,}0 = 5$ giây.\n2. Điều kiện: $n \\cdot t_{\\text{bước}} + t_{\\text{cuối}} \\le \\text{SLA} \\Leftrightarrow 5n + 3 \\le 45 \\Leftrightarrow n \\le 8{,}4$.\n3. $n$ nguyên nên `max_steps` $= \\lfloor 8{,}4 \\rfloor = 8$; thời gian xấu nhất $5 \\cdot 8 + 3 = 43$ giây.\n4. Kiểm tra $n = 9$: $48$ giây, vượt SLA.\n\n#### Hình minh hoạ\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 560 170\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:560px\">\n<text x=\"280\" y=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">8 bước × 5 s + trả lời cuối 3 s = 43 s ≤ 45 s</text>\n<rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"60\" width=\"28.8\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"48.8\" y=\"60\" width=\"17.2\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#10b981\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"66.0\" y=\"60\" width=\"11.5\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"77.5\" y=\"60\" width=\"28.8\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"106.2\" y=\"60\" width=\"17.2\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#10b981\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"123.5\" y=\"60\" width=\"11.5\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"135.0\" y=\"60\" width=\"28.8\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"163.8\" y=\"60\" width=\"17.2\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#10b981\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"181.0\" y=\"60\" width=\"11.5\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"192.5\" y=\"60\" width=\"28.8\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"221.2\" y=\"60\" width=\"17.2\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#10b981\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"238.5\" y=\"60\" width=\"11.5\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"250.0\" y=\"60\" width=\"28.8\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"278.8\" y=\"60\" width=\"17.2\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#10b981\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"296.0\" y=\"60\" width=\"11.5\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"307.5\" y=\"60\" width=\"28.8\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"336.2\" y=\"60\" width=\"17.2\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#10b981\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"353.5\" y=\"60\" width=\"11.5\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"365.0\" y=\"60\" width=\"28.8\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"393.8\" y=\"60\" width=\"17.2\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#10b981\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"411.0\" y=\"60\" width=\"11.5\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"422.5\" y=\"60\" width=\"28.8\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"451.2\" y=\"60\" width=\"17.2\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#10b981\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"468.5\" y=\"60\" width=\"11.5\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"480.0\" y=\"60\" width=\"34.5\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#ef4444\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n<line x1=\"537.5\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"537.5\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/>\n<text x=\"537.5\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#ef4444\">SLA 45 s</text>\n<text x=\"514.5\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"currentColor\">43 s</text>\n<rect x=\"20\" y=\"135\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#3b82f6\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"146\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"currentColor\">LLM 2,5 s</text>\n<rect x=\"120\" y=\"135\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#10b981\"/><text x=\"136\" y=\"146\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"currentColor\">tool 1,5 s</text>\n<rect x=\"215\" y=\"135\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"/><text x=\"231\" y=\"146\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"currentColor\">guardrail 1,0 s</text>\n<rect x=\"335\" y=\"135\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/><text x=\"351\" y=\"146\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"currentColor\">trả lời cuối 3 s</text>\n</svg>\n\n| Sai sót | Phép tính | Kết quả |\n|---|---|---|\n| Đúng | $\\lfloor (45 - 3)/5 \\rfloor$ | 8 |\n| Quên trả lời cuối | $45/5$ | 9 |\n| Quên guardrail | $\\lfloor (45 - 3)/4 \\rfloor$ | 10 |\n| Làm tròn lên | $\\lceil 8{,}4 \\rceil$ | 9 |\n\n#### Mở rộng\nNên giữ biên an toàn cho độ trễ đuôi (p99 của API thường cao hơn trung bình), ví dụ chọn 6–7 bước, và đặt timeout cho từng tool. Khi chạm giới hạn, agent trả kết quả một phần hoặc chuyển cho người thay vì im lặng thất bại.\n\n#### Đọc thêm\n- [Anthropic, Building effective agents](https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/building-effective-agents)\n- [OWASP LLM10:2025 Unbounded Consumption](https://genai.owasp.org/llmrisk/llm102025-unbounded-consumption/)\n"
